# Data. The raw Nashville CSV (1.04 GB) is never committed —
# scripts/download_data.py fetches it reproducibly. The two small processed
# files the app reads ARE committed so the app deploys with no download step
# (the licence is Open Data Commons Attribution; the citation is in the README
# and in the app):
#   data/processed/searches.parquet  4.8 MB  labelled search sample (src.data.load_searches)
#   data/processed/stops.parquet     ~22 MB  all stops, slim columns (scripts/build_stops_parquet.py)
data/raw/
data/processed/*
!data/processed/searches.parquet
!data/processed/stops.parquet
*.zip
*.csv
*.rds
*.RDS
*.parquet
*.feather
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.sqlite
*.db
!data/processed/searches.parquet
!data/processed/stops.parquet
!data/README.md

# Browser copy of the stops, regenerated by the app on first start
app/static/stops/

# Secrets — TABPFN_TOKEN and friends. Never commit; this repo is public.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.egg-info/
*.log

# Model + figure outputs
outputs/
*.pkl
*.joblib

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/

# Local OPP pipeline (scripts_claude): raw download, Census downloads, intermediate features
# Modelling table built by scripts_claude/build_master.py - committed on purpose
!data/nashville_consent_searches.parquet
!data/nashville_columns.csv

# Local pipeline outputs (scripts_claude) - rebuildable, too big for GitHub
opp_data/
